flowchart LR
  UI[User action] --> Local[Local state]
  Local --> IDB[(IndexedDB)]
  IDB --> Queue[Outbox queue]
  Queue --> Sync[Background sync]
  Sync --> API[Server API]
  API --> Resolve{Conflict?}
  Resolve -->|No| Commit[Commit server state]
  Resolve -->|Yes| Reconcile[Reconcile and notify]
  Commit --> Cache[TanStack Query cache]
  Reconcile --> Cache
